{"page":113,"width":1796,"height":2894,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"166","words":[{"text":"166","x":188,"y":155,"width":61,"height":32}]},{"text":"Chapter 3 프로세스","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":327,"y":156,"width":131,"height":31},{"text":"3","x":472,"y":157,"width":24,"height":25},{"text":"프로세스","x":528,"y":158,"width":98,"height":26}]},{"text":"원격 시스템은 서버의 포트 3027로 RPC 메시지를 보내면 필요한 정보를(이 시스템의","words":[{"text":"원격","x":326,"y":291,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"시스템은","x":413,"y":291,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"서버의","x":568,"y":292,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"포트","x":685,"y":296,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"3027로","x":768,"y":295,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"RPC","x":898,"y":296,"width":77,"height":32},{"text":"메시지를","x":993,"y":293,"width":139,"height":41},{"text":"보내면","x":1148,"y":294,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"필요한","x":1272,"y":294,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"정보를(이","x":1400,"y":296,"width":154,"height":44},{"text":"시스템의","x":1576,"y":295,"width":127,"height":48}]},{"text":"사우자목록) 얻을수 있다. 이 데이터는 응답 메시지 형대로 받게 된다.","words":[{"text":"사우자목록)","x":324,"y":357,"width":198,"height":42},{"text":"얻을수","x":539,"y":357,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":666,"y":357,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"이","x":757,"y":357,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"데이터는","x":803,"y":357,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"응답","x":951,"y":358,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"메시지","x":1034,"y":358,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"형대로","x":1152,"y":360,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"받게","x":1271,"y":360,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"된다.","x":1357,"y":360,"width":79,"height":40}]},{"text":"RPC는 클라이언트가 원격 호스트의 프로시저 호출히는 것을 마치 자기의 프로시","words":[{"text":"RPC는","x":387,"y":425,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트가","x":520,"y":422,"width":207,"height":41},{"text":"원격","x":744,"y":422,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"호스트의","x":828,"y":422,"width":134,"height":41},{"text":"프로시저","x":983,"y":425,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"호출히는","x":1140,"y":425,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1302,"y":425,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"마치","x":1390,"y":426,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"자기의","x":1482,"y":426,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"프로시","x":1609,"y":430,"width":93,"height":42}]},{"text":"저 호출하는 것처럼 해준다. RPC 시스템은 클라이언트 쪽에 스텁을 제공하여 통신을 하","words":[{"text":"저","x":323,"y":488,"width":30,"height":40},{"text":"호출하는","x":369,"y":489,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"것처럼","x":524,"y":488,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"해준다.","x":639,"y":488,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"RPC","x":762,"y":492,"width":77,"height":32},{"text":"시스템은","x":856,"y":488,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1004,"y":490,"width":175,"height":41},{"text":"쪽에","x":1192,"y":491,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"스텁을","x":1276,"y":491,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"제공하여","x":1400,"y":492,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"통신을","x":1560,"y":491,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"하","x":1676,"y":498,"width":30,"height":39}]},{"text":"는 데 필요한 자세한 사항들을 숨기 준다. 보통 원격 프로시저마다 다른 스텁이 존재한","words":[{"text":"는","x":321,"y":557,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"데","x":373,"y":554,"width":30,"height":40},{"text":"필요한","x":424,"y":554,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"자세한","x":542,"y":555,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"사항들을","x":659,"y":554,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"숨기","x":811,"y":554,"width":65,"height":41},{"text":"준다.","x":896,"y":555,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"보통","x":990,"y":558,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"원격","x":1076,"y":557,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"프로시저마다","x":1160,"y":557,"width":216,"height":41},{"text":"다른","x":1393,"y":558,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"스텁이","x":1482,"y":558,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"존재한","x":1607,"y":560,"width":98,"height":42}]},{"text":"다. 클라이언트가 원격 프로시저를 호출하면 RPC는 그에 대응하는 스텁을 호출하고 원","words":[{"text":"다.","x":322,"y":621,"width":41,"height":40},{"text":"클라이언트가","x":380,"y":621,"width":209,"height":41},{"text":"원격","x":602,"y":621,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"프로시저를","x":683,"y":621,"width":173,"height":41},{"text":"호출하면","x":869,"y":622,"width":137,"height":41},{"text":"RPC는","x":1022,"y":626,"width":115,"height":37},{"text":"그에","x":1150,"y":624,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"대응하는","x":1237,"y":624,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"스텁을","x":1395,"y":624,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"호출하고","x":1520,"y":624,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"원","x":1675,"y":630,"width":28,"height":39}]},{"text":"격 프로시저가 필요로 히는 매개변수를 건네춘다. 그러면 스텁이 원격 서버의 포트를 찾","words":[{"text":"격","x":323,"y":688,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"프로시저가","x":368,"y":687,"width":175,"height":41},{"text":"필요로","x":558,"y":688,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"히는","x":672,"y":688,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"매개변수를","x":754,"y":688,"width":173,"height":40},{"text":"건네춘다.","x":942,"y":689,"width":144,"height":42},{"text":"그러면","x":1102,"y":690,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"스텁이","x":1223,"y":690,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"원격","x":1346,"y":690,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"서버의","x":1433,"y":690,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"포트를","x":1557,"y":693,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"찾","x":1675,"y":696,"width":29,"height":40}]},{"text":"고 매개변수를 정€-(marshall)한다. 그 후 스텁은 메시지 전달 기법을 시용하여 서버에","words":[{"text":"고","x":320,"y":760,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"매개변수를","x":370,"y":754,"width":173,"height":40},{"text":"정€-(marshall)한다.","x":558,"y":754,"width":322,"height":45},{"text":"그","x":897,"y":761,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"후","x":945,"y":757,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"스텁은","x":994,"y":757,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"메시지","x":1114,"y":757,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"전달","x":1236,"y":757,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"기법을","x":1322,"y":757,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"시용하여","x":1445,"y":758,"width":143,"height":41},{"text":"서버에","x":1608,"y":757,"width":93,"height":46}]},{"text":"게 메시지를 전송한다. 이에 대응되는 스텁이 서버에도 존재하여 서버 측 스텁이 메시지","words":[{"text":"게","x":322,"y":821,"width":30,"height":40},{"text":"메시지를","x":369,"y":821,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"전송한다.","x":522,"y":821,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"이에","x":682,"y":821,"width":64,"height":42},{"text":"대응되는","x":763,"y":822,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"스텁이","x":914,"y":824,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"서버에도","x":1032,"y":824,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"존재하여","x":1186,"y":825,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"서버","x":1346,"y":826,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"측","x":1432,"y":826,"width":37,"height":39},{"text":"스텁이","x":1483,"y":825,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"메시지","x":1606,"y":824,"width":94,"height":46}]},{"text":"를 수신한 후 적절한 서버의 프로시저를 호출한다. 필요한 경우 반환 값들도 동일한 방","words":[{"text":"를","x":320,"y":890,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"수신한","x":369,"y":888,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"후","x":488,"y":889,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"적절한","x":539,"y":888,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"서버의","x":657,"y":889,"width":98,"height":41},{"text":"프로시저를","x":774,"y":889,"width":173,"height":41},{"text":"호출한다.","x":962,"y":891,"width":148,"height":41},{"text":"필요한","x":1130,"y":892,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"경우","x":1254,"y":893,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"반환","x":1339,"y":893,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"값들도","x":1429,"y":893,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"동일한","x":1554,"y":892,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"방","x":1674,"y":896,"width":30,"height":39}]},{"text":"식으로 다시 되돌려 준다. Windows 시스템에서는 스텁 코드 Microsoft lnterface","words":[{"text":"식으로","x":321,"y":955,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"다시","x":443,"y":956,"width":63,"height":41},{"text":"되돌려","x":529,"y":956,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"준다.","x":648,"y":956,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"Windows","x":743,"y":960,"width":169,"height":33},{"text":"시스템에서는","x":932,"y":958,"width":212,"height":42},{"text":"스텁","x":1161,"y":960,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"코드","x":1251,"y":965,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"Microsoft","x":1341,"y":964,"width":189,"height":32},{"text":"lnterface","x":1546,"y":963,"width":157,"height":37}]},{"text":"Definition Language (MIDL)로 작성된 명세로부터 컴파일된다. 이 언어는 클라이","words":[{"text":"Definition","x":321,"y":1027,"width":185,"height":33},{"text":"Language","x":522,"y":1029,"width":173,"height":41},{"text":"(MIDL)로","x":711,"y":1028,"width":172,"height":36},{"text":"작성된","x":901,"y":1026,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"명세로부터","x":1024,"y":1026,"width":170,"height":41},{"text":"컴파일된다.","x":1218,"y":1028,"width":188,"height":42},{"text":"이","x":1427,"y":1029,"width":31,"height":40},{"text":"언어는","x":1483,"y":1028,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"클라이","x":1606,"y":1028,"width":94,"height":44}]},{"text":"언트와 서버 프로그램 사이의 인터페이스를 정의하는 데 시용된다.","words":[{"text":"언트와","x":323,"y":1092,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"서버","x":437,"y":1092,"width":64,"height":41},{"text":"프로그램","x":517,"y":1092,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"사이의","x":667,"y":1092,"width":99,"height":41},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":784,"y":1093,"width":207,"height":41},{"text":"정의하는","x":1005,"y":1094,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"데","x":1158,"y":1095,"width":30,"height":40},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1205,"y":1095,"width":153,"height":42}]},{"text":"매개변수 정€-(parameter marshalling)은 클라이언트와 서버 기기의 데이터 표현","words":[{"text":"매개변수","x":385,"y":1161,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"정€-(parameter","x":536,"y":1161,"width":260,"height":47},{"text":"marshalling)은","x":809,"y":1162,"width":263,"height":46},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":1083,"y":1161,"width":218,"height":42},{"text":"서버","x":1313,"y":1165,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"기기의","x":1400,"y":1165,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"데이터","x":1523,"y":1163,"width":101,"height":42},{"text":"표현","x":1642,"y":1168,"width":61,"height":38}]},{"text":"방식의 차이 문제를 해결한다. 32비트 정수를 예로 들어보자. 어떤 기계는 최상위 바이","words":[{"text":"방식의","x":321,"y":1229,"width":99,"height":41},{"text":"차이","x":440,"y":1230,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"문제를","x":521,"y":1229,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"해결한다.","x":640,"y":1229,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"32비트","x":802,"y":1229,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"정수를","x":929,"y":1229,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"예로","x":1049,"y":1229,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"들어보자.","x":1133,"y":1229,"width":152,"height":42},{"text":"어떤","x":1306,"y":1232,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"기계는","x":1394,"y":1232,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"최상위","x":1520,"y":1231,"width":103,"height":42},{"text":"바이","x":1642,"y":1232,"width":58,"height":43}]},{"text":"트(most-significant byte)를 먼저 저장하고(big-endian), 어떤 기계(little-endian)","words":[{"text":"트(most-significant","x":320,"y":1301,"width":329,"height":44},{"text":"byte)를","x":663,"y":1299,"width":126,"height":45},{"text":"먼저","x":806,"y":1297,"width":63,"height":41},{"text":"저장하고(big-endian),","x":891,"y":1297,"width":380,"height":45},{"text":"어떤","x":1291,"y":1299,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"기계(little-endian)","x":1380,"y":1301,"width":323,"height":45}]},{"text":"는 최하위 바이트(least-significant byte)를 먼저 저장한다. 둘 중 어느 쪽이 “낫다”","words":[{"text":"는","x":320,"y":1369,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"최하위","x":373,"y":1367,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"바이트(least-significant","x":493,"y":1367,"width":401,"height":45},{"text":"byte)를","x":910,"y":1366,"width":129,"height":46},{"text":"먼저","x":1058,"y":1364,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"저장한다.","x":1147,"y":1364,"width":151,"height":44},{"text":"둘","x":1319,"y":1369,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"중","x":1374,"y":1370,"width":38,"height":39},{"text":"어느","x":1432,"y":1369,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"쪽이","x":1521,"y":1368,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"“낫다”","x":1612,"y":1368,"width":91,"height":42}]},{"text":"고 말할 수 없으며 컴퓨터 구조의 선택이다. 이와 같은 차이를 해결하기 위해 대부분의","words":[{"text":"고","x":320,"y":1440,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"말할","x":369,"y":1435,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":453,"y":1436,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"없으며","x":505,"y":1434,"width":96,"height":41},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":622,"y":1433,"width":96,"height":41},{"text":"구조의","x":737,"y":1434,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"선택이다.","x":859,"y":1433,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"이와","x":1025,"y":1432,"width":70,"height":42},{"text":"같은","x":1109,"y":1433,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"차이를","x":1196,"y":1434,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"해결하기","x":1321,"y":1437,"width":140,"height":41},{"text":"위해","x":1483,"y":1437,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"대부분의","x":1572,"y":1436,"width":130,"height":43}]},{"text":"RPC 시스템은 기종 중립적인 데이터 표현 방식을 정의한다. 이러한 표현 방식 중 하나","words":[{"text":"RPC","x":319,"y":1506,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"시스템은","x":414,"y":1502,"width":137,"height":41},{"text":"기종","x":566,"y":1503,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"중립적인","x":646,"y":1501,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"데이터","x":801,"y":1502,"width":98,"height":42},{"text":"표현","x":919,"y":1501,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"방식을","x":1003,"y":1501,"width":106,"height":41},{"text":"정의한다.","x":1125,"y":1502,"width":149,"height":42},{"text":"이러한","x":1295,"y":1504,"width":108,"height":42},{"text":"표현","x":1417,"y":1505,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"방식","x":1505,"y":1505,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"중","x":1592,"y":1505,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"하나","x":1642,"y":1504,"width":63,"height":42}]},{"text":"가 XDR (external data representation)이다. 클라이언트 측에서는 서버에게 데이터","words":[{"text":"가","x":321,"y":1570,"width":34,"height":40},{"text":"XDR","x":367,"y":1575,"width":89,"height":30},{"text":"(external","x":467,"y":1574,"width":156,"height":36},{"text":"data","x":635,"y":1574,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"representation)이다.","x":722,"y":1570,"width":357,"height":46},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1095,"y":1570,"width":180,"height":42},{"text":"측에서는","x":1288,"y":1573,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"서버에게","x":1448,"y":1572,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"데이터","x":1608,"y":1572,"width":93,"height":42}]},{"text":"를 보내기 전 매개변수 정돈 작업의 일환으로 전송할 데이터를 기종 중립적인 XDR 형","words":[{"text":"를","x":320,"y":1640,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"보내기","x":369,"y":1638,"width":99,"height":42},{"text":"전","x":489,"y":1639,"width":31,"height":39},{"text":"매개변수","x":536,"y":1639,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"정돈","x":689,"y":1638,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"작업의","x":771,"y":1639,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"일환으로","x":894,"y":1639,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"전송할","x":1047,"y":1639,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"데이터를","x":1168,"y":1640,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"기종","x":1329,"y":1641,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"중립적인","x":1414,"y":1641,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"XDR","x":1576,"y":1644,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"형","x":1676,"y":1642,"width":25,"height":39}]},{"text":"태로 바꾸어서 보낸다. 수신측 기계에서는 XDR 데이터를 받으면 매개변수를 풀어내면","words":[{"text":"태로","x":322,"y":1706,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"바꾸어서","x":404,"y":1707,"width":133,"height":41},{"text":"보낸다.","x":556,"y":1707,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"수신측","x":682,"y":1706,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"기계에서는","x":802,"y":1707,"width":174,"height":42},{"text":"XDR","x":989,"y":1711,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"데이터를","x":1092,"y":1707,"width":143,"height":41},{"text":"받으면","x":1249,"y":1709,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"매개변수를","x":1374,"y":1709,"width":183,"height":41},{"text":"풀어내면","x":1570,"y":1707,"width":134,"height":41}]},{"text":"서 자기 기종의 형태로 데이터를 바꾼 후 서버에게로 넘겨준다.","words":[{"text":"서","x":323,"y":1774,"width":29,"height":40},{"text":"자기","x":368,"y":1774,"width":64,"height":41},{"text":"기종의","x":451,"y":1776,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"형태로","x":565,"y":1776,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"데이터를","x":679,"y":1775,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"바꾼","x":829,"y":1776,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"후","x":910,"y":1776,"width":36,"height":40},{"text":"서버에게로","x":959,"y":1775,"width":176,"height":41},{"text":"넘겨준다.","x":1149,"y":1776,"width":150,"height":40}]},{"text":"또 다른 중요한 문제는 호출의 의미에(semantic) 관한 것이다. 지역 프로시저 호출","words":[{"text":"또","x":386,"y":1847,"width":35,"height":28},{"text":"다른","x":435,"y":1843,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"중요한","x":516,"y":1843,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"문제는","x":632,"y":1844,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"호출의","x":749,"y":1843,"width":101,"height":42},{"text":"의미에(semantic)","x":869,"y":1843,"width":288,"height":44},{"text":"관한","x":1174,"y":1844,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":1263,"y":1845,"width":115,"height":41},{"text":"지역","x":1397,"y":1846,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"프로시저","x":1484,"y":1843,"width":140,"height":41},{"text":"호출","x":1642,"y":1845,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 경우 극단적인 경우에만 실패하지만 RPC 경우는 네트워크 오류 때문에 실패할 수도","words":[{"text":"의","x":325,"y":1909,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"경우","x":372,"y":1909,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"극단적인","x":452,"y":1911,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"경우에만","x":603,"y":1911,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"실패하지만","x":752,"y":1911,"width":174,"height":41},{"text":"RPC","x":938,"y":1915,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"경우는","x":1033,"y":1911,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"네트워크","x":1153,"y":1912,"width":143,"height":41},{"text":"오류","x":1310,"y":1916,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"때문에","x":1398,"y":1913,"width":106,"height":41},{"text":"실패할","x":1523,"y":1912,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"수도","x":1641,"y":1911,"width":65,"height":40}]},{"text":"있고, 메시지가 중복되어 호출이 여러 번 실행될 수도 있다. 이 문제를 해결하는 방법은","words":[{"text":"있고,","x":326,"y":1976,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"메시지가","x":417,"y":1977,"width":137,"height":41},{"text":"중복되어","x":566,"y":1978,"width":133,"height":41},{"text":"호출이","x":716,"y":1979,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":836,"y":1979,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"번","x":921,"y":1979,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"실행될","x":968,"y":1978,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"수도","x":1086,"y":1978,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"있다.","x":1176,"y":1979,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"이","x":1273,"y":1981,"width":29,"height":40},{"text":"문제를","x":1321,"y":1981,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"해결하는","x":1446,"y":1980,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"방법은","x":1607,"y":1978,"width":99,"height":40}]},{"text":"운영체제가 메시지가 최니/ 한 번 실행되는 것이 아니라 정확하 한번 처리되도록 보장하","words":[{"text":"운영체제가","x":323,"y":2044,"width":175,"height":42},{"text":"메시지가","x":511,"y":2045,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"최니/","x":659,"y":2045,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"한","x":743,"y":2046,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"번","x":793,"y":2046,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"실행되는","x":839,"y":2046,"width":137,"height":41},{"text":"것이","x":992,"y":2046,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"아니라","x":1077,"y":2047,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"정확하","x":1198,"y":2047,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"한번","x":1323,"y":2048,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"처리되도록","x":1410,"y":2048,"width":182,"height":40},{"text":"보장하","x":1606,"y":2046,"width":100,"height":40}]},{"text":"게 하는 것이다. 대부분의 지역 프로시저 호출은 “정확히 한 번”의 기능성을 가지고 있으","words":[{"text":"게","x":326,"y":2111,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":371,"y":2112,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":454,"y":2113,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"대부분의","x":579,"y":2113,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"지역","x":726,"y":2113,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"프로시저","x":806,"y":2114,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"호출은","x":957,"y":2114,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"“정확히","x":1076,"y":2114,"width":116,"height":41},{"text":"한","x":1210,"y":2115,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"번”의","x":1261,"y":2115,"width":82,"height":40},{"text":"기능성을","x":1361,"y":2115,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"가지고","x":1520,"y":2113,"width":108,"height":42},{"text":"있으","x":1643,"y":2113,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"나 이를 구현하는 것은 더 어렵다.","words":[{"text":"나","x":325,"y":2178,"width":34,"height":40},{"text":"이를","x":373,"y":2179,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"구현하는","x":452,"y":2180,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"것은","x":603,"y":2180,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"더","x":682,"y":2180,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"어렵다.","x":728,"y":2180,"width":108,"height":41}]},{"text":"우선 “최대 한 만을 고려하자. 이 의미는 각 메시지에 타임스탬프를 매기는 것으로","words":[{"text":"우선","x":389,"y"